From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lynxtron Scripts <scripts@lynxtron>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Wait for runtime and isolate shutdown before platform release

Coordinate terminal teardown on each owning JS loop and wait for Node's
per-isolate uv cleanup before allowing the host to release its platform.

---
diff --git a/core/runtime/js/bytecode/v8/v8_cache_generator.cc b/core/runtime/js/bytecode/v8/v8_cache_generator.cc
